{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"metadata grounded release notes metadata grounded release notes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md","fileName":"Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Metadata-Grounded Release Notes","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted DevOps Practice]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"metadata grounded release notes metadata grounded release notes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md","fileName":"Metadata-Grounded Release Notes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Metadata-Grounded Release Notes","heading":"Metadata-Grounded Release Notes","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Metadata-grounded release notes are generated only from controlled fields such as merged pull-request titles, labels, authors, and bodies. The workflow first creates a structured report, then groups changes into a fixed format without inventing features, fixes, infrastructure work, or breaking changes.\n\nThe generated document is validated for required sections and nonempty content, then used to create a draft rather than a published release. This separates documentation assistance from release authority: AI improves consistency and audience readability, while a human reviews the draft before the [[Release Pipeline]] communicates it as an official release.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddin